id: brim/repeat
name: the same answer on a repeat run
prose: "A repeat run on the same picture answers the same, to the letter: the measurement is a pure computation on the decoded bytes."
scope:
- src/**
- Makefile
- materials/bordered.jpg
covers:
- R1
- R2
- R3
- R4
rows:
- run: "a=$(./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg) && b=$(./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg) && [ \"$a\" = \"$b\" ] && printf '%s\\n' \"$a\""
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
